# Vertical Development Conventions (MFE)

When creating or modifying feature libraries in this workspace:

- Use `inject()` function, never constructor injection
- Use `ChangeDetectionStrategy.OnPush` on all components
- Use `HttpClient` via inject for HTTP calls
- Put feature code in `libs/{app-name}/src/lib/`
- Follow the structure in `lib/_reference/`
- Write a `.spec.ts` for every `.ts` file
- Use typed interfaces, never `any` or `unknown`
- Import `authGuard` from `@pervaxis/canvas-auth` on all protected routes
- Use CSS custom properties for styling
- Export public API from `src/index.ts` barrel file
- Use signals for component state
- Keep components standalone with explicit imports
- Export routes as `MFE_ROUTES` from the library
